     </article>
 
     <section class="section" aria-labelledby="tac-heading">
-      <div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Volume I</p><h2 id="tac-heading">Tactical Agentic Coding</h2></div><p>1 of 8 chapters · 12.5%</p></div>
+      <div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Volume I</p><h2 id="tac-heading">Tactical Agentic Coding</h2></div><p>2 of 8 chapters · 25%</p></div>
       <div class="lesson-list">
